							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />AFK[65 Archon]<b> <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1015600" target="_blank"><span style="color: blue;">Heloisa</span></a> </b>(Wood Elf) &lt;Fires of Time&gt;<br />Servant of Tunare Babe<br /><br /><font size="1">&quot;Fish heads.. fish heads... roly poly fish heads... fish heads.. fish heads... eat them up...&nbsp; YUM!&quot;</font>
						</td>
