	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7767"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 206<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7767#msg7767"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7767#msg7767">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> May 06, 2004, 01:34:19 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							ack! &nbsp;Say it isn&#039;t so! &nbsp;Not another set of god forsaken epic quests! &nbsp;@#$#@... @#$$... damn it... SOB.... b@$tards... I hate those damn quests. &nbsp;Finally when they&#039;re so outdated that we don&#039;t have every damn person who levels up wanting help getting their epic, they want to introduce more. &nbsp;GAH! &nbsp;Hate. &nbsp;I feel nothing but hate. &nbsp; :P<br /><br />No epics. &nbsp;No epics. &nbsp;No epics. &nbsp;No epics.<br /><br />I have no doubt a level cap increase will be totally screwed up. &nbsp;<br /><br />The lore isn&#039;t surprising. &nbsp;I had little doubt when Gates came out that if they did another expansion it would be set in whatever world the invading armies came from.<br /><br />At least it&#039;ll have decent cover art and splash screen. &nbsp;Larry Elmore won&#039;t churn out something like that craptastic piece they had done for GoD.<br /><br />Check the screenshots. &nbsp;Notice the rats? &nbsp;I tell ya, that&#039;s why I play EQ! &nbsp;At level 1 I was killing rats. &nbsp;For years I&#039;ve wanted nothing more than to progress through their many, many expansions so I can finally reach the incredibly dangerous (and uber!) Realms of Discord... so I can kill rats. &nbsp; ;D &nbsp;edit: &nbsp;There are bats too! &nbsp;Woot!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 06, 2004, 01:46:13 pm by Callon</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7768"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269" title="View the profile of Ssnakess">Ssnakess</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Gecko not Geico<br />
								Global Moderator<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/stargmod.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 215<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/kof1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								die plz<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" title="Ascent Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Ssnakess@mail2hell.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7768#msg7768"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7768#msg7768">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> May 06, 2004, 02:17:17 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							What a bunch of bullshit.<br /><br />There are so many fucking bugs with GoD, so many things they need to fix before even considering another expansion.<br /><br />I realize its set for July 27th, but seriously, for once could we just fix the fucking game first?<br /><br />As fun as it is to have mobs fall through the floor and become unhittable...and getting stuck on rocks and such...I think I&#039;d like to be able to run through PoK without having EQ lock up, rather than having 15 new zones that are all bugged to hell.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
