							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Finally when they&#039;re so outdated that we don&#039;t have every damn person who levels up wanting help getting their epic, they want to introduce more. &nbsp;GAH! &nbsp;Hate. &nbsp;I feel nothing but hate. &nbsp;</div>It won&#039;t be newbs runnin around tryin to make pickup raids etc for these epics.
