							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Also, the rumor is you will need to have X amount of aap to level up too. Last I heard it was something like 5-700 aap for level 70.<br /><br />July 27th... Hmm, I wonder if that&#039;s when WoW opens beta? ;) Cause that day high end EQ dies, except for one or two guilds serverwide made up of all the x-servers left...
