							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 206<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7776#msg7776"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7776#msg7776">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> May 06, 2004, 04:32:24 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Also, the rumor is you will need to have X amount of aap to level up too. Last I heard it was something like 5-700 aap for level 70.</div><br />Yeah, that&#039;s a rumor but would be a good idea. &nbsp;Maybe that will help keep people from gimping their own exp in the rush to level up. &nbsp;If you&#039;re mainly fighting exp mobs that are L60-64, then getting to 70 will nerf the hell out of your exp. &nbsp;You won&#039;t get the +/- 5 level bonus on most of your old mobs. &nbsp;But they already have L62-65 exp mobs who hit for 1200+, so to be consistent, if they make 1 group exp areas in the new expansion that are almost entirely L65-70 mobs, how tough will those bastards be? &nbsp;1500 hits? &nbsp;2k? &nbsp;More?<br /><br />If you&#039;re L65 with very little AA, pre elem gear, etc. you&#039;d be insane to level to 70 and make it so you have to go to those spots to get your exp bonus. &nbsp;<br /><br />Anyway, I could definitely see people ruining their own exp rate because of the pressure to level to 70. &nbsp;If there&#039;s a minimum AA requirement to ding, at least you&#039;ll have to have that much power to advance. &nbsp;Of course it won&#039;t help with gear. &nbsp;<br /><br />To those who complain AA shouldn&#039;t be required to level, their just trying to protect you from yourself. &nbsp;:D &nbsp;That and &quot;alternate&quot; doesn&#039;t mean optional. &nbsp;It just means different. &nbsp;There&#039;s no reason it couldn&#039;t be required to advance. &nbsp;:P
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
