								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7788#msg7788">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> May 07, 2004, 07:12:03 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Tired of golems, they were cute in LDoN, overused in GoD, and now they&#039;re just boring.
						</td>
					</tr>
