	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7789"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202" title="View the profile of xaanru">xaanru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 29<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								I&#039;m not a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=202"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.sonsofkings.com" title="Sons of Kings Guild" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7789#msg7789"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7789#msg7789">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> May 07, 2004, 09:27:52 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							My prediction:<br /><br />They advertise it as 30+ or something like that, to appeal to the broad player base. Then they put about 8 level 29 mobs near the zone in of the &nbsp;first zone. Everything else in the expansion, will be level 65+ require wierd configurations of groups, and mobs will only be able to be killed by stupid combinations of class, race, and weapon type (this mob can only be killed by a gnome warrior using piercing weapons, then of course it will drop necro loot). Keys and flags will be necessary to do anything, and all scripts will be bugged.<br /><br />Half the player base will not notice, as they will decide its like GoD and they cannot go there. The other half will not notice, because they are playing WoW, FF11, or some other game.<br /><br />Sony will wonder what they did wrong, and toss a few monty haul GM events to the players, to try to keep them happy.<br /><br />The Oracle has spoken!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Xaanru 65th lvl Archon of Marr <br />Sons of Kings guild <br />Rodcet Nife <br />Tradeskills<br />GrandMaster Smith(250) ** GM Trophy<br />Master Baker(200)<br />Master Fletcher (200)<br />Master Jeweler (200)<br />Master Brewer (200)<br />Master Tailor (238)<br />Master Potter (194)<br />Master Fisherman (186)<br />Master Drunk (188)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7790"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 227<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7790#msg7790"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7790#msg7790">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> May 07, 2004, 09:32:13 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Callon link=board=1;threadid=815;start=0#msg7776 date=1083875544</div><div class="quote"><br />To those who complain AA shouldn&#039;t be required to level, their just trying to protect you from yourself. &nbsp;:D &nbsp;That and &quot;alternate&quot; doesn&#039;t mean optional. &nbsp;It just means different. &nbsp;There&#039;s no reason it couldn&#039;t be required to advance. &nbsp;:P<br /></div><br />That is a really good point I thought. My first thought when I heard that the level cap would be raised was...<br /><br />&quot;OMG this is the first time I have been at max level when an expansion comes out, I better max my EXP bar so that one blue will ding me to 66!&quot; <br /><br />I of course have less than 50 AAXP at this point, and havn&#039;t even completed ND yet! (slay undead was just so game breaking I had to have it &nbsp;:<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> &nbsp;) Untill you said something I completely forgot about nerfing my own XP by levelling. My job is primarily tanking and add tanking, and there is no way in hell that i am going to survive against an appropriate XP mob to a level 66, with midgrade LDON gear, and 50 AAXP. No way.. not going to happen. Good insight<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=139779" target="_blank">Gabus Magelo Profile</a><br />Proud member of <a href="http://Tul-Acharn.com" target="_blank">Tul Acharn</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7792"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 33<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7792#msg7792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7792#msg7792">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> May 07, 2004, 11:25:22 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote from: xaanru link=board=1;threadid=815;start=0#msg7789 date=1083936472</div><div class="quote">My prediction:<br /><br />They advertise it as 30+ or something like that, to appeal to the broad player base. Then they put about 8 level 29 mobs near the zone in of the &nbsp;first zone. Everything else in the expansion, will be level 65+</div><br />In all fairness, I think the stat I have seen thrown around is that 80% of accounts have a level 65 toon on them, not surprising considering how easy it is to get to level 65. <br /><br />So, it only makes sense to have all new content scaled for level 65 and up - creating new grind zones for people below level 65 is just plain stupid at this point of the game.<br /><br />Now, saying all content should be scaled to level 65 and higher does not mean all content should be scaled to Time+ gear players, although a good portion (perhaps a majority of it?) should be.<br /><br />As for these AA requirements in order to unlock levels 66-70, if this is true, that will be the end of EQ for me, no doubt about it. &nbsp;Hello WoW, goodbye EQ. &nbsp;Why the hell should I be forced to get advanced trap negotiation and all the other useless rogue AAs just so I can unlock new levels? &nbsp;Grinding in EQ is boring as it is, there is no way I&#039;m going to double my current AA&#039;s just to be able to access levels 66-70.<br /><br />My prediction: &nbsp;OoW will introduce &quot;Improved Shroud of Stealth&quot; for rogues for 30 AAs which will allow us once again to be invisible to many of the mobs in GoD that currently see through it. Wuwu~!<br /><br />No thanks.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7793"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 206<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7793#msg7793"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=815.msg7793#msg7793">Re:New Epic &amp; Expansion</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> May 07, 2004, 11:33:55 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Now, saying all content should be scaled to level 65 and higher does not mean all content should be scaled to Time+ gear players, although a good portion (perhaps a majority of it?) should be.</div><br />I highly doubt it&#039;s anyways near 80%, but yes, there are a lot of L65s in the game. &nbsp;Why would most new content be for Time gear + though? &nbsp;The vast majority of level 65s don&#039;t have Time gear.<br /><br />Don&#039;t forget casters... soon you will have to throw away your Focus IV items and replace them with Focus V. &nbsp; &nbsp;:P
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
